{
  "_comment": [
    "The single source of truth for Kafka topics — ADR-0002's table, as data.",
    "infra/bootstrap_topics.py creates these; libs/pipeline/topics.py (Phase 2)",
    "will read this same file so application code and infra can never disagree.",
    "Partition counts are a ceiling on consumer parallelism and are painful to",
    "change later (it remaps keys to partitions), so they are over-provisioned."
  ],
